            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Hi, I am trying to achieve auto-spacing inside a pair of `$`. This is essential for typst setup.\r\nHowever, this setup does not work. I tried to substitute the `neigh_pattern` as `%(%)` and it just works for `()` pairs. Could you help me on that?\r\n```lua\r\nrequire(\"mini.pairs\").setup({\r\n  mappings = {\r\n    [\" \"] = { action = \"open\", pair = \"  \", neigh_pattern = \"%$%$\" },\r\n    [\"$\"] = { action = \"closeopen\", pair = \"$$\" },\r\n  },\r\n})\r\n```",
